                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Do you like metroidvania style games? You sidescroll around the world unlocking abilities which will allow you to progress in other places and pick up treasures. Yeah that's pretty much the formula here. But you do it all underwater, you have different forms to change between as you unlock them and there's a cooking system where you can mash materials together to create healing items and buff items.\r\n\r\nAll in all it takes about 10 hours to beat and it doesn't outstay its welcome.",
